{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17106590","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17106590","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1710659001:1":{"text":"衛兵カントが、殿下にご報告申し上げます！","source_cn":"殿下！卫兵康特，向您报道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF23088674F2075A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710659002:1":{"text":"畏まる必要はない。先ほどの襲撃で、守備軍に負傷者は出なかったか？","source_cn":"不必拘礼。刚才巨蛛突然冲撞过来，守备军们没有受伤吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BBADA84BFC915E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710659003:1":{"text":"隊員が数名、軽傷を負いましたが、すでに応急処置は済んでおり、いずれも命に別状はありません。","source_cn":"回殿下，有几位同僚受了轻伤，但已得到初步救治，并无大碍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD45083FE0D4CFF7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710659004:1":{"text":"グウィネス隊長が迅速に対応し、一撃でクモの急所を射抜いたおかげです！","source_cn":"多亏格温妮丝队长出手果决，一箭便击中了巨蛛要害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x292EFA1009C1BED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710659005:1":{"text":"我々が気付いたときには、クモはすでに倒れていました。残るは後始末だけです。","source_cn":"待我们反应过来时，巨蛛已经倒下了，就只剩下收拾残局的工作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27DBC02784E34CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","